Package: ReefMappeR
Title: Reef Habitat Mapping and Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(person("Viktoria", "Veith",email = "Viktoria.veith@t-online.de",role  = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Tools for cropping, analyzing, and visualizing seagrass, bathymetry, and benthic habitat data for reef ecosystems. Integrates GEBCO, Allen Coral Atlas, and global seagrass datasets.
